{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01GBPXxmPL1Aut6Z7Rst1TuV","type":"tool_result","content":"# Default Review Form Scoring Dimensions\n\n## Rating Scale (Overall Recommendation)\n\nThe review form uses a **10-point integer scale** for paper evaluation:\n\n- **10**: \"Top 5% of accepted papers, seminal paper\"\n- **9**: \"Top 15% of accepted papers, strong accept\"\n- **8**: \"Top 50% of accepted papers, clear accept\"\n- **7**: Good paper meriting acceptance\n- **6**: Marginally above acceptance threshold\n- **5**: Marginally below acceptance threshold\n- **4**: \"Ok but not good enough - rejection\"\n- **3**: Clear rejection\n- **2**: Strong rejection\n- **1**: Trivial or wrong\n\n## Confidence Scale\n\nReviewers also indicate their evaluation certainty using a **5-point scale**:\n\n- **5**: Absolute certainty with extensive relevant literature familiarity\n- **4**: Confident but not absolutely certain about correctness\n- **3**: Fairly confident in the evaluation\n- **2**: Willing to defend evaluation despite possible misunderstandings\n- **1**: \"evaluation is an educated guess\"\n\n## Additional Review Components\n\nThe form also captures a brief **title** (max 500 characters) and a detailed **review** section supporting 1-20,000 characters with Markdown and LaTeX formatting capabilities for comprehensive paper evaluation."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"fa2e3739-cf35-4bf4-84d7-4c529d34ab0f","uuid":"49149a27-4ff6-4fe0-b9ac-13021162d5e8","timestamp":"2026-05-15T22:57:59.853Z","tool_use_result":{"bytes":5304,"code":200,"codeText":"OK","result":"# Default Review Form Scoring Dimensions\n\n## Rating Scale (Overall Recommendation)\n\nThe review form uses a **10-point integer scale** for paper evaluation:\n\n- **10**: \"Top 5% of accepted papers, seminal paper\"\n- **9**: \"Top 15% of accepted papers, strong accept\"\n- **8**: \"Top 50% of accepted papers, clear accept\"\n- **7**: Good paper meriting acceptance\n- **6**: Marginally above acceptance threshold\n- **5**: Marginally below acceptance threshold\n- **4**: \"Ok but not good enough - rejection\"\n- **3**: Clear rejection\n- **2**: Strong rejection\n- **1**: Trivial or wrong\n\n## Confidence Scale\n\nReviewers also indicate their evaluation certainty using a **5-point scale**:\n\n- **5**: Absolute certainty with extensive relevant literature familiarity\n- **4**: Confident but not absolutely certain about correctness\n- **3**: Fairly confident in the evaluation\n- **2**: Willing to defend evaluation despite possible misunderstandings\n- **1**: \"evaluation is an educated guess\"\n\n## Additional Review Components\n\nThe form also captures a brief **title** (max 500 characters) and a detailed **review** section supporting 1-20,000 characters with Markdown and LaTeX formatting capabilities for comprehensive paper evaluation.","durationMs":3891,"url":"https://docs.openreview.net/reference/default-forms/default-review-form"}}
