{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_016V5Db2K1VZpRfneMf8ccmP","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_15/projects/vla-ssd/report.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# Handover — 2026-05-15\\\\n\\\\n> 由 Agent 生成，每次状态变更后自动更新。硬限 150 行。\\\\n\\\\n## 运行中\\\\n（无）\\\\n\\\\n## 待处理\\\\n- lg_output_head_analysis: D021 Exp-2: Output Head Analysis. Compare trained vs untrained VLA weight differences across layers. If training does \\\\\\\"shallow adaptation\\\\\\\", output head weight diff >> middle layer weight diff. Explains \\\\\\\"representations unchanged but behavior improved\\\\\\\".（排队等待 GPU）\\\\n- lg_instruction_ablation: D021 Exp-1: Instruction Ablation. Extract LIBERO-Goal features with empty instruction (trained + untrained VLA), then run RSA. If instruction pathway is the source of action-relevant structure, RSA should collapse from ρ≈0.49 to <0.15. PASS: ρ<0.15; PARTIAL: 0.15<ρ<0.30; FAIL: ρ≥0.30.（排队等待 GPU）\\\\n\\\\n## 近期结论\\\\n- **p0_bootstrap_ci_training_effect** (success): P0: Bootstrap CI on training effect (image_mean aggregation). Trained RSA=0.5014 vs untrained RSA=0.4847, Δ=+0.017. Task-level resampling bootstrap 95% CI. If CI excludes 0 → Claim 3 needs minor adjustment (\\\\\\\"minimal but detectable\\\\\\\"). If CI includes 0 → Claim 3 \\\\\\\"invariance\\\\\\\" holds.\\\\n- **p0_image_mean_rsa_verify** (success): P0 CRITICAL: Verify Claim 2 (LLM degrades action alignment 0.615→0.488) is not an aggregation artifact. SigLIP uses mean pooling, VLA used last_preaction. Re-run RSA with image_mean feature key for trained with-inst and untrained with-inst. If image_mean RSA ≈ 0.61 → Claim 2 is artifact. If ≈ 0.49 → Claim 2 holds.\\\\n- **plan_003_perlayer_degradation** (success): D028 plan_003: Per-layer RSA degradation curve. Track RSA from SigLIP+projector output (L0=0.615) through LLM layers 1-32 (~0.48). If monotonic decrease → LLM progressively degrades action alignment. If non-monotonic → some layers partially recover. Supports Claim 2 (LLM degrades action-relevant structure).\\\\n\\\\n## 趋势\\\\n成功 23 / 负向 7 / 失败 0 / 共 36\\\\n\\\\n## 下一步\\\\n（无活跃 idea，请通过 ideas.md 添加）\\\\n\\\\n## 资源状态\\\\nwestd-19183: 无 GPU 信息\\\\n\\\\n## 告警\\\\n- mvp2_action_probe: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- lg_extract_trained_r2: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- lg_extract_untrained_r2: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- lg_extract_trained_r1: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- lg_extract_untrained_r1: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- lg_shuffled_token_control: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 2097, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01UV8vdWoyvMWQvY1i8sYMCV","session_id":"fa2e3739-cf35-4bf4-84d7-4c529d34ab0f","uuid":"f9f807a0-750f-441b-9710-89bac934ce28","timestamp":"2026-05-15T22:58:55.250Z"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01NmkqWDXJzEDx975CyVA9JP","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_011Wt6HFgbJid1SXzcywChUi","name":"mcp__agent-ml-research__read_project_file","input":{"project":"vla-ssd","file":"memory.md","max_chars":0},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2390,"cache_read_input_tokens":16716,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":2390,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":62,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01UV8vdWoyvMWQvY1i8sYMCV","session_id":"fa2e3739-cf35-4bf4-84d7-4c529d34ab0f","uuid":"38f1c59e-3c7f-489d-8c7f-a31ad6325e32"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_011Wt6HFgbJid1SXzcywChUi","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_15/projects/vla-ssd/memory.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# VLA-SSD Project Memory\\\\n\\\\n## SMOKING GUN 确认：SigLIP+Projector RSA = 0.6153（2026-05-15）\\\\n\\\\n**d027_siglip_only_rsa 结果**: SigLIP+projector 直接输出（不过 LLM）的 RSA = 0.6153 [95% CI: 0.5257, 0.6954]。\\\\n\\\\n**关键发现：LLM 降低 action alignment（不是 passthrough）**：\\\\n- SigLIP+projector: **0.6153**\\\\n- Full VLA（任何条件）: ~0.48-0.49\\\\n- DINO: 0.388\\\\n\\\\nLLM 不仅没增强 action-relevant structure，反而将 RSA 从 0.615 降到 ~0.488（约 20% 下降）。这比 \\\\\\\"passthrough\\\\\\\" 更强——是 \\\\\\\"degradation\\\\\\\"。\\\\n\\\\n**机制解释**: SigLIP image-text 预训练产生的 visual features 天然具有强 action-relevant 结构。Projector 保持这一结构（cos_sim=1.0 frozen）。LLM 的高维 token mixing 稀释了这种结构（trained 和 untrained LLM 稀释程度一致）。\\\\n\\\\n## Per-Layer Degradation Curve 发现（2026-05-15）\\\\n\\\\n**plan_003_perlayer_degradation 结果**：降解非单调，集中在 embedding interface。\\\\n\\\\n**关键机制洞察**：\\\\n- Proj→L1 是最大 single-step drop（0.13–0.25，~20–40%），token embedding 是 degradation bottleneck\\\\n- L0（embedding layer）是异常值：trained 模型 RSA≈0，结构从 L1 才开始恢复\\\\n- 中间层有 partial recovery（non-monotonic），LLM 不是 \\\\\\\"progressive degrader\\\\\\\"\\\\n- **no-inst trained 独特模式**：唯一呈 L1→L30 持续上升的条件（peak at L30），training 在无 instruction 时让 LLM 逐层积累 action 信号。其余 3 个条件均 non-monotonic\\\\n- 总降解幅度 ~0.13：best LLM layer 仍比 projector 低 ~0.127\\\\n\\\\n**对 Claim 2 措辞影响**：应从 \\\\\\\"LLM degrades action alignment\\\\\\\" 精炼为 \\\\\\\"LLM's token embedding interface introduces primary degradation; subsequent layers partially but incompletely recover\\\\\\\"。这个 nuance 对 discussion section 很重要——说明 LLM 不是纯粹有害，而是 \\\\\\\"lossy interface + partial recovery\\\\\\\"。\\\\n\\\\n## 完整 2×2 Matrix + SigLIP-only（2026-05-15）\\\\n\\\\n| 条件 | RSA | 备注 |\\\\n|------|-----|------|\\\\n| **SigLIP+Projector (no LLM)** | **0.6153** | smoking gun |\\\\n| Trained with-inst | 0.4876 | L9 peak |\\\\n| Trained no-inst | 0.489 | L30 peak |\\\\n| Untrained with-inst | 0.4846 | L12 peak |\\\\n| Untrained no-inst | 0.4802 | — |\\\\n| DINO | 0.388 | — |\\\\n\\\\n**结论**: 所有 4 个 full VLA 条件收敛在 0.48-0.49 band。SigLIP-only 显著高于 full VLA。Training 和 instruction 均无 meaningful effect。\\\\n\\\\n## Instruction Ablation FAIL — Option B 被否证（2026-05-15）\\\\n\\\\n**d021_instruction_ablation 结果**: no-inst untrained RSA = 0.4802 ≈ with-inst 0.4846（Δ=0.0044 << 0.10 阈值）。去掉 instruction text 不影响 action-relevant 表征结构。Option B 被明确否证。\\\\n\\\\n## Output Head Analysis 发现（2026-05-15，d021_output_head_analysis = negative）\\\\n\\\\n**Vision backbone + Projector 在 trained 和 untrained 之间完全一致**（rel_change=0, cos_sim=1.0）。这是 trained ≈ untrained 表征结构相似的因果机制。\\\\n\\\\n**Shallow adaptation FAIL**: LLM 权重变化均匀分布 32 层（1.22-1.37），output head 并不特殊（1.12x ratio vs 3x 阈值）。\\\\n\\\\n**Caveat**: trained vs untrained 比较的是 pretrained Llama + fine-tune vs random init，不是 fine-tuned vs pre-fine-tuning。\\\\n\\\\n## RSA Temporal Phase 差异（2026-05-15）\\\\n\\\\n| Phase | Trained | Untrained | DINO |\\\\n|-------|---------|-----------|------|\\\\n| early | 0.32 | **0.41** | **0.49** |\\\\n| mid | 0.52 | **0.52** | 0.41 |\\\\n| late | **0.48** | 0.46 | 0.26 |\\\\n\\\\n## 文献关键发现\\\\n\\\\n14 篇论文确认 vision encoder dominance 是已知现象（behavioral level）。我们在 representation level 发现同一模式，是独特贡献。Grant 2026: LIBERO-Goal 中 language 贡献关键（behavioral level），OFT checkpoint。\\\\n\\\\n## Novelty Gap\\\\n\\\\n| 工作 | 做了什么 | 没做什么 |\\\\n|------|---------|---------|\\\\n| Grant et al. 2026 | Behavioral intervention, \\\\\\\"encoded but not used\\\\\\\" | 无 trained vs untrained 对比 |\\\\n| Swann/Buurmeijer | SAE interpretability on OpenVLA+LIBERO | 无 language features 分析 |\\\\n| LIBERO-CF | Counterfactual behavioral benchmark | 无 representation analysis |\\\\n\\\\n## 方向 Pivot 历史\\\\n\\\\nMVP-1 Temporal Distance → G2 FAIL → MVP-2 Action Prediction → G2 FAIL → Action-Delta → G3 FAIL → D015 Pivot LIBERO-Goal → D018 Goal Classification → G3 FAIL → D019 RSA → G2 FAIL → D021 Instruction Ablation (FAIL) + Output Head (negative) → D027 Option A2 锁定 → **SigLIP-only SMOKING GUN PASS → MVP Gate 通过**\\\\n\\\\n## 技术约束\\\\n\\\\n- Untrained model: from_config() 重新初始化 LLM（6.74B random），保留 SigLIP（0.80B）\\\\n- D017: 统一用 LIBERO-10 fine-tuned checkpoint（LIBERO-Goal 是 OOD 测试）\\\\n- Token 聚合：Primary = last pre-action token\\\\n- 存储：根分区 ~30GB，大文件在 /root/autodl-tmp/vla-ssd/\\\\n- **分析 Worker 不得覆盖 spec 字段**\\\\n- **服务器无外网**：AutoProcessor/HF 操作必须 `local_files_only=True`\\\\n- **Instruction ablation bug**: `if args.task_instruction:` 对空字符串返回 False，已修复\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 3945, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01UV8vdWoyvMWQvY1i8sYMCV","session_id":"fa2e3739-cf35-4bf4-84d7-4c529d34ab0f","uuid":"6f2fa998-a0a9-44fa-93f0-5afd83150987","timestamp":"2026-05-15T22:59:02.363Z"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01NmkqWDXJzEDx975CyVA9JP","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_0115Ljivj89AmaRZehRdCmrg","name":"mcp__agent-ml-research__read_project_file","input":{"project":"vla-ssd","file":"paper_framing.md","max_chars":0},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2390,"cache_read_input_tokens":16716,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":2390,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":62,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01UV8vdWoyvMWQvY1i8sYMCV","session_id":"fa2e3739-cf35-4bf4-84d7-4c529d34ab0f","uuid":"2bc719fc-bd1f-4329-b790-96b318764d85"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_0115Ljivj89AmaRZehRdCmrg","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_15/projects/vla-ssd/paper_framing.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# Paper Framing — vla-ssd\\\\n\\\\n## Target Venue\\\\n- Primary: CoRL 2026\\\\n- Deadline: Abstract May 26, Paper May 29\\\\n- Format: 8 pages + references\\\\n\\\\n## Core Claims (3 条)\\\\n\\\\n1. **Vision Encoder Dominance**: VLA 中 action-relevant 表征结构由 frozen vision encoder（SigLIP）决定。SigLIP+projector 的 RSA 与 action structure 的相关性（ρ=0.615）远高于完整 VLA（ρ≈0.501, image_mean 聚合）和 standalone vision model（DINOv2 ρ=0.388）。\\\\n2. **LLM Degrades Action Alignment**: LLM 的 token embedding interface 引入主要降解（Proj→L1 drop 20-40%），后续层部分恢复但净降解 ~18% 持续存在（SigLIP 0.615 → VLA 0.501，用相同 mean pooling 聚合）。这一模式在 trained/untrained、with/without instruction 四种条件下一致。Per-layer curve 显示非单调降解（非简单递减），LLM self-attention 部分恢复 action-relevant 结构但无法完全弥补 interface loss。\\\\n3. **Training and Instruction Invariance**: VLA task-specific fine-tuning 和 instruction input 均不显著改变 LLM hidden state 中的 action-relevant 表征结构。image_mean 聚合下 training Δ=0.021，95% CI=[−0.031, +0.064]，p=0.20；last_preaction 下 Δ=0.008，95% CI=[−0.040, +0.056]，p=0.37。两个 CI 均包含 0。2×2 matrix（training × instruction）四格收敛于 0.48-0.50。\\\\n\\\\n## Paper 主数值基准（image_mean 聚合，公平对比）\\\\n\\\\n| Model / Condition | RSA (image_mean) | Notes |\\\\n|---|---|---|\\\\n| **SigLIP+Projector** | **0.615** | Smoking gun, LLM input |\\\\n| VLA trained with-inst | 0.501 | Peak L23 |\\\\n| VLA untrained with-inst | 0.485 | Peak L23 |\\\\n| VLA trained no-inst | — | Pending image_mean recompute |\\\\n| VLA untrained no-inst | — | Pending image_mean recompute |\\\\n| DINO-V2 | 0.388 | Vision-only baseline |\\\\n\\\\nlast_preaction 数值（trained 0.488, untrained 0.485）放 supplementary 作为 robustness check。\\\\n\\\\n## Story Spine\\\\n\\\\n- **Problem**: VLAs 通过 fine-tuning LLM on robot data 实现 impressive performance，但 action-relevant 表征从何而来？业界隐性假设 fine-tuning 注入 new representational knowledge，但无系统性验证。\\\\n- **Existing approaches & gaps**: Grant et al. 2026 从 behavioral level 发现 visual pathway dominates，但未做 representational decomposition。无人测量过 VLA 各组件（vision encoder / projector / LLM）对 action-relevant 表征结构的独立贡献。\\\\n- **Our framing**: 首次对 VLA 进行系统性 representational analysis——7 种 probing 方法 × 2 benchmarks × 组件级分解，定量揭示 action-relevant 结构的来源。发现 LLM 不仅不贡献，反而 degrades vision encoder 提供的 action alignment。\\\\n- **Headline result**: \\\\\\\"SigLIP+projector representations achieve RSA ρ=0.615 with action structure, while the full VLA only achieves ρ≈0.501 regardless of training or instruction — the LLM degrades rather than enhances action-relevant representations.\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n## Anticipated Reviewer Concerns & Responses\\\\n\\\\n### C1: 单一 VLA 架构（OpenVLA）泛化性\\\\n- **应对**: Scope 明确限定为 \\\\\\\"OpenVLA-class architecture\\\\\\\"。OpenVLA 是最广泛使用的开源 VLA 之一，findings 对该架构族直接适用。Discussion 中讨论扩展到其他架构的预期。\\\\n- **实验**: 无需额外实验，Limitations 明确标注。\\\\n\\\\n### C2: SigLIP vs DINOv2 pretraining confound\\\\n- **问题**: SigLIP 是 image-text contrastive pretrained，DINOv2 是 self-supervised。RSA gap 可能来自 language-aware pretraining 而非纯 vision encoder 质量。\\\\n- **应对**: 这个 confound 实际上 **强化** 我们的 story——如果 gap 来自 SigLIP 的 vision-language pretraining，说明 pretraining 阶段的 language grounding 远比 task-specific fine-tuning 重要。Discussion 正面讨论此 confound 并将其转化为 insight。\\\\n- **实验**: P2 可补 CLIP vs DINOv2 对比，但非 blocking。\\\\n\\\\n### C3: LLM degradation 机制不清\\\\n- **问题**: 为什么 LLM 降低 action alignment？\\\\n- **应对**: LLM 对 representation 做 next-token prediction 优化的变换，这与保持 action-relevant geometric structure 目标不同。Projector bottleneck（D026 发现 SigLIP+projector frozen）约束了信息通路。Discussion 讨论 information bottleneck 解释。\\\\n- **实验**: Per-layer RSA degradation curve 作为 P1 supplementary evidence。\\\\n\\\\n### C4: Grant 2026 checkpoint 差异\\\\n- **问题**: Grant 用 OFT fine-tuned，我们用 standard fine-tuning checkpoint。\\\\n- **应对**: 我们用 standard fine-tuning 是更强的测试——如果完全不同的 LLM 权重（random init vs pretrained+finetuned，cos_sim≈0.2）都不改变表征，OFT 更不会。Related Work 明确区分。\\\\n\\\\n### C5: Practical implications 不够\\\\n- **问题**: 发现了问题，然后呢？\\\\n- **应对**: 三个可操作建议：(1) 投资 vision encoder pretraining 质量比 LLM fine-tuning 更重要；(2) representation-based downstream tasks 应直接使用 projector output 而非 LLM hidden states；(3) VLA 架构设计应关注减少 LLM 对 visual structure 的 degradation。\\\\n\\\\n### C6: 聚合方式伪影（已解决）\\\\n- **问题**: SigLIP 用 mean pooling，VLA 用 last token，比较不公平。\\\\n- **应对**: ✅ 已用 image_mean 聚合验证。VLA image_mean RSA=0.501，仍远低于 SigLIP 0.615（gap=0.114）。两种聚合方式结果一致（last_preaction 0.488 vs image_mean 0.501）。主文使用 image_mean 保证公平，last_preaction 放 supplementary。\\\\n\\\\n## Key Evidence Inventory\\\\n\\\\n| Evidence | Claim | Status |\\\\n|----------|-------|--------|\\\\n| SigLIP+Projector RSA=0.615 | C1, C2 | ✅ Done |\\\\n| Full VLA RSA ≈ 0.501 (image_mean, 4 conditions) | C2, C3 | ✅ Done |\\\\n| DINO RSA=0.388 | C1 | ✅ Done |\\\\n| 6 probing methods × 2 benchmarks: trained ≈ untrained | C3 | ✅ Done |\\\\n| Instruction ablation Δ=0.004 | C3 | ✅ Done |\\\\n| 2×2 matrix Bootstrap CI includes 0 | C3 | ✅ Done |\\\\n| Output head analysis: SigLIP+projector frozen | C1, C2 | ✅ Done |\\\\n| Per-layer RSA degradation curve | C2 | ✅ Done — non-monotonic, Proj→L1 primary drop |\\\\n| VLA image_mean RSA (aggregation robustness) | C2 | ✅ Done — 0.501 vs SigLIP 0.615, gap=0.114 |\\\\n| Bootstrap CI on training effect (image_mean) | C3 | ✅ Done — CI includes 0, invariance holds |\\\\n| Random instruction control | C3 | 📋 P1 planned |\\\\n\\\\n## Literature Positioning\\\\n\\\\n- **Grant et al. 2026**: Behavioral level \\\\\\\"visual pathway dominates\\\\\\\" → 我们 representational level 确认 + 定量组件分解\\\\n- **Fang 2025**: \\\\\\\"Fine-tuning erodes VLM reasoning\\\\\\\" → 我们发现 LLM step 本身（不只是 fine-tuning）就降低 visual structure\\\\n- **Hou 2026 (LangGap) / Fei 2025 (LIBERO-Plus)**: \\\\\\\"VLAs ignore language instructions\\\\\\\" → 我们从 representation level 解释 why：instruction text 对表征结构无实质影响\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 5379, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01UV8vdWoyvMWQvY1i8sYMCV","session_id":"fa2e3739-cf35-4bf4-84d7-4c529d34ab0f","uuid":"8ad6c418-c04f-4df1-bebb-8384bc772f4e","timestamp":"2026-05-15T22:59:02.837Z"}
