{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01HypspWk1T5RXWDHC2UvGWG","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"# 项目 vla-ssd 概况\\n\\n## 实验状态 (38 个)\\n\\n- **lg_extract_trained_r1**: DONE (killed) — \\n- **mvp2_delta_dino**: DONE (success) — \\n- **mvp2_delta_untrained**: DONE (success) — \\n- **mvp2_delta_trained**: DONE (success) — \\n- **mvp2_action_dino**: DONE (success) — \\n- **mvp2_action_untrained**: DONE (success) — \\n- **mvp2_action_trained**: DONE (success) — \\n- **dinov2_baseline**: DONE (success) — \\n- **mvp_controlb_untrained**: DONE (success) — \\n- **mvp_controlb_trained**: DONE (success) — \\n- **mvp_001**: DONE (negative) — \\n- **mvp_probe_untrained**: DONE (success) — \\n- **mvp_probe_trained**: DONE (negative) — \\n- **openvla-untrained-extract**: DONE (success) — \\n- **openvla-trained-extract**: DONE (success) — \\n\\n## 最新报告\\n# Handover — 2026-05-15\\n\\n> 由 Agent 生成，每次状态变更后自动更新。硬限 150 行。\\n\\n## 运行中\\n（无）\\n\\n## 待处理\\n- lg_output_head_analysis: D021 Exp-2: Output Head Analysis. Compare trained vs untrained VLA weight differences across layers. If training does \\\"shallow adaptation\\\", output head weight diff >> middle layer weight diff. Explains \\\"representations unchanged but behavior improved\\\".（排队等待 GPU）\\n- lg_instruction_ablation: D021 Exp-1: Instruction Ablation. Extract LIBERO-Goal features with empty instruction (trained + untrained VLA), then run RSA. If instruction pathway is the source of action-relevant structure, RSA should collapse from ρ≈0.49 to <0.15. PASS: ρ<0.15; PARTIAL: 0.15<ρ<0.30; FAIL: ρ≥0.30.（排队等待 GPU）\\n\\n## 近期结论\\n- **p0_bootstrap_ci_training_effect** (success): P0: Bootstrap CI on training effect (image_mean aggregation). Trained RSA=0.5014 vs untrained RSA=0.4847, Δ=+0.017. Task-level resampling bootstrap 95% CI. If CI excludes 0 → Claim 3 needs minor adjustment (\\\"minimal but detectable\\\"). If CI includes 0 → Claim 3 \\\"invariance\\\" holds.\\n- **p0_image_mean_rsa_verify** (success): P0 CRITICAL: Verify Claim 2 (LLM degrades action alignment 0.615→0.488) is not an aggregation artifact. SigLIP uses mean pooling, VLA used last_preaction. Re-run RSA with image_mean feature key for trained with-inst and untrained with-inst. If image_mean RSA ≈ 0.61 → Claim 2 is artifact. If ≈ 0.49 → Claim 2 holds.\\n- **plan_003_perlayer_degradation** (success): D028 plan_003: Per-layer RSA degradation curve. Track RSA from SigLIP+projector output (L0=0.615) through LLM layers 1-32 (~0.48). If monotonic decrease → LLM progressively degrades action alignment. If non-monotonic → some layers partially recover. Supports Claim 2 (LLM degrades action-relevant structure).\\n\\n## 趋势\\n成功 23 / 负向 7 / 失败 0 / 共 36\\n\\n## 下一步\\n（无活跃 idea，请通过 ideas.md 添加）\\n\\n## 资源状态\\nwestd-19183: 无 GPU 信息\\n\\n## 告警\\n- mvp2_action_probe: 已被终止 — unknown\\n- lg_extract_trained_r2: 已被终止 — unknown\\n- lg_extract_untrained_r2: 已被终止 — unknown\\n- lg_extract_trained_r1: 已被终止 — unknown\\n- lg_extract_untrained_r1: 已被终止 — unknown\\n- lg_shuffled_token_control: 已被终止 — unknown\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01YMZR2Ut5PENTD1SzPLZjDQ","session_id":"fa2e3739-cf35-4bf4-84d7-4c529d34ab0f","uuid":"938b37fe-d4cd-410a-a655-a6ec70014e1c","timestamp":"2026-05-15T22:59:22.402Z"}
