rease → LLM progressively degrades action alignment. If non-monotonic → some layers partially recover. Supports Claim 2 (LLM degrades action-relevant structure).\\\\n\\\\n## 趋势\\\\n成功 23 / 负向 7 / 失败 0 / 共 36\\\\n\\\\n## 下一步\\\\n（无活跃 idea，请通过 ideas.md 添加）\\\\n\\\\n## 资源状态\\\\nwestd-19183: 无 GPU 信息\\\\n\\\\n## 告警\\\\n- mvp2_action_probe: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- lg_extract_trained_r2: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- lg_extract_untrained_r2: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- lg_extract_trained_r1: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- lg_extract_untrained_r1: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- lg_shuffled_token_control: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 2097, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01YMZR2Ut5PENTD1SzPLZjDQ","session_id":"fa2e3739-cf35-4bf4-84d7-4c529d34ab0f","uuid":"865e23de-cc94-4ed7-8e0b-0e08cccbe315","timestamp":"2026-05-15T22:59:23.255Z"}
